[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #              DT_NEEDED (-lm): same behaviour, different dynamic footprint
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m #
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m # If plain vs fat diverges on the same rows where C vs Rust diverges, those rows
